{"ID":"20240220132610-epdlg7j","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132610-epdlg7j","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132610-epdlg7j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170518-b86606r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170518-sxzmujk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170518-sxzmujk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:86,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:86\u0026#125;","title":"【茵陈蒿汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312170518-b86606r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170518-b86606r","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百五十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170518-faxajik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170518-faxajik","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，发热汗出，此为越热，不能发黄也。但头汗出，身无汗，剂颈而还，小便不利，渴饮水浆者，此为瘀热在里，身必发黄，「茵陈蒿汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170518-xtog342","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170518-xtog342","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“越热”热往外走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。不能发黄，黄的定义，是热没办法往外出。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄有两种，一种阳黄，一种阴黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果黄很暗，是很危险的症状，只要接触到阴都是很危险的。阳黄，虽然黄但是很光鲜亮丽的黄。现在讲的是阳黄。金匮还会讲到黄汗，黄汗发生在以前黄河边，摆渡为生，天气很热流汗，跳水里，造成黄汗。这里讲阳黄，瘀热在里面排不掉。「阳明病」，发热汗出，此为越热，发热汗流出来了，热跑出来了，不会发黄。“但头汗出，身无汗，剂颈而还，”阴经到喉咙边。消化系统肠胃在中焦，肠胃有热的时候，汗发出去，热就卸掉了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么会小便不利？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在有表邪，固到，汗没有发出去，胃里很热一直往上冲，造成头汗出，胃里非常热。当热一直往上越的时候，叫越热。当胃热越出来，里面空掉了，中焦会空掉，人身体上是没有空隙的，当热往上跑的时候，湿来补位，一般这种平素有湿的人，胖子湿很盛，瘦的不会，湿都排掉了。湿来补位变成湿梗在中间，整个腹部都是湿，上面是热的。湿在中焦很盛的时候，人正常的津液呢，是这样走向：水从大肠到肺里面去以后，肺是肾之母，肺里面的津液除了主皮毛以外，鼻孔以外，津液会慢慢回到肾脏里面去。肺水往下降，肺法像天，天下雨了，肾接到，小便排出来，这是常态，结果上面太热了，中间湿隔到，水上去下不来了，小便不利，上去的水，“但头汗出”，全部排掉了，中间是空的，病人渴，肺里没水了，很想喝水。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这就是为什么小便不利的原因"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，他是有热有湿，也有实导致。这个症状"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上面是热，中间是湿的，下面是实的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有三个症在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170518-11xojno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170518-11xojno","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经方是药简力专，所以我们要开三个药，去热，去湿，去实。茵陈蒿汤这样来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170518-81x4xe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170518-81x4xe9","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈蒿汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170518-k8aiz08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170518-k8aiz08","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈蒿六两。栀子十四枚。大黄二两去皮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170518-nu7csog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170518-nu7csog","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水一斗，先煮茵陈，减六升，纳二味，煮取三升，去滓，分温三服，小便当利，尿如皂角汁，色正赤，一宿腹减，黄从小便去也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170518-5ussvpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170518-5ussvpg","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵陈篙不要开六两啊，茵陈篙和栀子是等量四钱，大黄两钱就可以了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170518-79riil5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170518-79riil5","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黄在调胃承气汤，和大承气用到的时候用酒泡一下，因为调胃承气跟大承气里有芒硝，芒硝是很咸寒的东西，大黄酒泡一下比较温热，不会怕肠胃伤到。其他地方就是大黄直接丢下去。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈篙专门去湿，大黄去下焦的实，栀子去上焦的热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为他是阳黄，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃茵陈篙利出的小便非常黄非常暗，有时候黑的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈篙汤是去黄的专剂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。临床上看到急性肝炎都是茵陈篙汤，都是阳黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170518-0i6waln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170518-0i6waln","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵陈蒿非常好用，只有三味药，句句都是重点。我们临床上用的很多，只要看到病人一黄，大便没有，就结束了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170518-sxzmujk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170518-sxzmujk","updated":"20240312170518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先煮茵陈，煮取它的药味，因为湿很盛的时候，我们取它药的味。药味很重，湿很多梗到，茵陈多熬一下。“尿如皂角汁，色正赤，”颜色会有这种反应才对。如果不是这样反应，你开错处方了。"}]}]}